	"Description": "Network Prediction adapter of GSTN Input: the input command, the embeddable input simulation and simulator, command binding set, input sources, context providers and the Mover sim-state tracker. Needs the GAS-NPP fork plugins (GameplayAbilities, AbilitySystemSimulation, NetworkPrediction) and Mover, which are therefore regular dependencies of this plugin.",
